# location-tracking-system

## Core Components (app/geo.py)

1. Multi-Provider Geolocation Service
- Primary and fallback location providers
- Automatic provider switching on failure
- Location data normalization across providers

2. Accuracy Verification
- Radius-based location accuracy calculations
- Confidence scoring for location precision
- Jurisdiction boundary validation

3. Security Features
- VPN/proxy detection system
- Location spoofing prevention
- Compliance verification checks

## Data Flow

1. Location Request Chain
- Initial geolocation request
- Provider availability check
- Fallback provider selection
- Location data normalization

2. Verification Process
- Accuracy radius calculation
- Boundary validation against jurisdiction
- VPN/proxy status check
- Compliance status determination

## Business Rules

1. Location Compliance
- Required accuracy thresholds by jurisdiction
- Maximum allowed radius variance
- Required check-in frequency
- Geographic boundary restrictions

2. Provider Management
- Provider priority order
- Failure threshold definitions
- Data quality requirements
- Service level agreements

